Version: 0.1.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Audio Labs Pro Developers <contact@audiolabspro.internal>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libasound2 (>= 1.2.0)
Recommends: pipewire-audio-client-libraries
Suggests: alsa-utils
Description: Professional Voice Audio Workstation
 Audio Labs Pro is a modern, responsive voice audio workstation built in Rust.
 It combines non-destructive multitrack audio editing with local speech synthesis,
 voice cloning, automated transcription, speech cleanup DSP, and an undoable
 session engine.
 .
 Features include:
  - Sample-accurate multitrack editing, crossfades, and rippled deletes
  - Real-time voice cleanup DSP: high-pass, parametric EQ, de-hum, de-click, compressor, and limiter
  - Integrated Voice Lab with built-in neural TTS synthesis and script editor
  - Local voice dictation and clip transcription with SRT and WebVTT exports
  - Consent-gated voice profiling, reference quality auditing, and A/B acoustic comparison
  - Liquid-smooth GPU interface with dynamic glass themes and Wayland support
